==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fro|entrechange}}, {{surf|en|inter-|change|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
; Verb
* {{enPR|ĭntə(r)chānj'|a=RP}}, {{IPA|en|/ɪntə(ɹ)ˈtʃeɪndʒ/}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-interchange (verb).wav|a=Southern England}}
* {{enPR|ĭntərchānj'|a=US}}, {{IPA|en|/ɪntɚˈt͡ʃeɪnd͡ʒ/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-interchange-verb.ogg|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|eɪndʒ|s=3}}
; Noun
